      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0035" n="art0035">
        <head>SYM I NOON 9S Coffee Essence</head>
        <p>SYM I NOON 9S Coffee Essence</p>
        <p>No other- fsse ace can make such a delicious"' refreshinsv beverage'</p>
        <p>The health and Vigour of an individual depends upon quantity and quality of the Blood. When the tissues have been at work there are thrown into tlie blood waste products and if these be not eliminated but (through any cause detained in the blood) they influence nutrition and funcsia and finally produce organic disease." 'Humanitarian,' of cases of Scrofula, Scurvey, Eczema, Bad Legs, Skin and Blood Diseases, Pimples and Sores of all kinds, the effectiveness of Clarke's Blood Mixture is marvellous. Thousands of wonderful cures have .been effected by it. Clarke's Blood Mixture sold evers- where, at 2s. 9d. per bottle. Beware of worthless imitations and substitutes.—Advt. 5. ONE BOX OF CLARKE'S B 41 PILLS is warranted to cure, in either sex, all acquired or constitu- tic.nal discharges, from the Urinary Organs, Gravel and Pains in the back. Free froM Mercury. Established upwards of 50 years. In boxes 4s. 6d. each, of all chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors throughout the world, or sent for sixty stamps. by the makers The Lincoln and Midland Counties Drug Co., Lincoln.-Advt.</p>
