      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0041" n="art0041">
        <head>MILITARY.</head>
        <p>MILITARY.</p>
        <p>And Challenge Cup pre- sented hy Col. Hall Walker A. Adam 32</p>
