      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0051" n="art0051">
        <head>PLACE FOR USE.</head>
        <p>PLACE FOR USE.</p>
        <p>---1</p>
        <p>Below you will find the recipe for a home remedy that is simple and inexpensive, but so wonderfully good for Rheumatism ard Kidney Trouble that it is freely declared to be worth five shillings a drop to those who have tried all the expensive remedies and high-priced specialists without relief. To make the remedy, get from any drug store: Tincture Gentian Compound, one ounce; Syrup Rheubarb, one ounce; Liquid Barkola Compound, one ounce; Syrup of Ginger, five ounces. Shake them up together in a bottle and take one teaspoonful after meals and at bedtime for one full week after all the pain and soreness and special symptoms of either Rheumatism or the Kidney Trouble have been overcome.</p>
