      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0055" n="art0055">
        <head>Huge Government Majority.</head>
        <p>Huge Government Majority.</p>
        <p>The scene in the House of Commons on Thursday' evening during the closing hours of the debate was a memorable one, and not for many years has there been. a larger attendance at St. Stephen's. Altogether, upwards of 560 members responded to the apecial whips which had been sent out by the various parties in the House, or less, than one hundred of the total strength. Of these 528 went into th€. lobbies, the voting being : Against the rejection . FOT</p>
        <p>.... 379 .... 149</p>
        <p>Government majority</p>
        <p>One packet of Provost Oats makes more and better porridge than 15 packets of foreign</p>
        <p>oats.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0056" n="art0056">
        <head>rovost Scotch les</head>
        <p>rovost Scotch les</p>
        <p>Provost Oats are so rich that they need more water than other prepared oats—give them room to boil and do not forget the pinch of salt in the water before boiling.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0057" n="art0057">
        <head>Domestic Servants. etc.</head>
        <p>Domestic Servants. etc.</p>
