      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-11-06_WidnesExaminer_art0115" n="art0115">
        <p>Don't be satisfied with saying" I'm praty well, thank you. Vi-Cocoa will enable you to say " I'm first rate !”</p>
        <p>Before starting work in the morning, either with break- fast or before breakfast every father of a family should satisfy himself with a large cupful of Vi-Cocoa. It will increase the vital energy so necessary in the strenuous life men lead to-day. On his return home in the evening, perhaps tired and worn out, a large steaming cup of</p>
