        <p>should be taken by every wage-earning father • whose strength must be maintained. It will quickly cheer and refresh him after the day's toil, and produce a renewal of energy and vitality. If you are wise you will give Vi-Cocoa a trial at once. It. may be the one thing you have been searching for for years. Your grocer keeps it and you can get a package to-clay for sixpence</p>
