        <p>A ROYAL VISITOR. JEFFRIES TO MEET The Queen Dowager Sophia cf Sweden is JOHNSON. raying a lengthy visit to this country. For many years her Majesty has suffered from Jim Jeffries and Jack Johnson have agreed nasal catarrh, and she has been recommended to box for the heavy-weight championship of to spend the winter in England. She has the world before the club offering the largest taken a house at Pinner, but at present she is inducement, bids to be submitted before staying incognito in the Hyde Park Hotel as December Ist. Each man is to deposit 5,000 Countess Haga. &amp;Is. forfeit and an additional 5,000 dais. as a side bet. Our photograph is that of Jeffries.</p>
